  "content": {
    "title": "When are Coachella tickets on sale? And who's headlining in 2026?",
    "text": "COACHELLASabrina Carpenter, Justin Bieber, Karol G set to headline Coachella 2026Ema Sasic Brian BlueskyePalm Springs Desert SunSept. 15, 2025Updated March 13, 2026, 5:46 a.m. PTThere's about to be (more than) one less lonely girl at the Empire Polo Club this spring. The headliners for the 2026 Coachella Valley Music and Arts Festival were announced late Monday, Sept. 15.Pop singers Sabrina Carpenter and Justin Bieber and reggaeton/pop songstress Karol G are set to headline the world-famous event in April. EDM artist Anyma will also present \"AEden\" in the fourth \"headlining\" slot, along with Radiohead \"Kid A Mnesia\" in something new called the \"Bunker.\"",
